# dist 内禁止提交数据库（尤其本机绝对路径符号链接，会破坏 GitHub Pages/Jekyll 构建）
dist/comm_hub.db
dist/*.db
dist/*.db-shm
dist/*.db-wal
.DS_Store
uploads/
